OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA bright
OL,6,Fevening with variable amounts of
OL,7,Fcloud. The rest of the night will then
OL,8,Fbe dry for the most part, however
OL,9,FShetland may see some showers later.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FA few showers at first across
OL,12,FShetland, otherwise a dry and bright
OL,13,Fmorning. Cloud will thicken through
OL,14,Fthe afternoon, with outbreaks of rain
OL,15,Fspreading northwards.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FCloudy
OL,18,Fon Tuesday and Wednesday with
OL,19,Foutbreaks of occasionally heavy rain.
OL,20,FDrier and brighter on Thursday with
OL,21,Fthe risk of a few showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
